WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Dr Okafor>Good morning. Let's go over the scan results from last week.</v>

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
<v Dr Okafor>How have you been feeling since the last visit?</v>

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Patient>Better, thanks. The cough has mostly settled and I am sleeping through.</v>

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Dr Okafor>Good. The scan shows the nodule is stable, so we will keep the plan and start letrozole after the next bloods.</v>
